        "original_id": "fea3ab57-9991-5ce2-9e8c-4f90ae98541f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Arts Fuse, Visionaire\n- People: Gerald Peary, Cecilia Dean\n- Places: Greater Boston, Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, New York, New England\n- Topics: online arts magazines, transmedia, art and fashion\n\nFacts:\n- The Arts Fuse is a Boston-based online arts magazine covering cultural events in Greater Boston and in Connecticut, Maine, Massachusetts, New Hampshire, Rhode Island, Vermont, and New York.\n- The Arts Fuse presents itself as a next-generation platform for arts and culture consumers across New England and beyond.\n- Gerald Peary is a critic-at-large for The Arts Fuse.\n- Visionaire is a transmedia company that publishes the magazine Visionaire.\n- Visionaire also concepts, curates, and produces art multiples, events, public art installations, film, branded content, apparel, and publications.\n- Cecilia Dean is a co-founder of Visionaire, a multimedia art and fashion company.",
